  ('esfinge-do-valor', 'Legendary Action Uses', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, '3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the sphinx can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The sphinx regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.', 5),
  ('esfinge-do-valor', 'Arcane Prowl', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The sphinx can teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see, and it makes one Claw attack.', 6),
  ('esfinge-do-valor', 'Weight of Years', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 16, one creature the sphinx can see within 120 feet. Failure: The target gains 1 Exhaustion level. While the target has any Exhaustion levels, it appears 3d10 years older. Failure or Success: The sphinx can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.', 7),
  ('esfinge-dos-segredos', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The sphinx makes three Claw attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Curse of the Riddle.', 1),
