  ('espantalho', 'Terrifying Glare', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, one creature the scarecrow can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the end of the scarecrow’s next turn. While Frightened, the target has the Paralyzed condition.', 2),
