  ('urso-homem', 'Bite (Bear or Hybrid Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '17', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 17 (2d12 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Humanoid, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14. Failure: The target is cursed. If the cursed target drops to 0 Hit Points, it instead becomes a Werebear under the DM’s control and has 10 Hit Points. Success: The target is immune to this werebear’s curse for 24 hours.', 2),
  ('urso-homem', 'Handaxe (Humanoid or Hybrid Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '14', 'Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 14 (3d6 + 4) Slashing damage.', 3),
  ('urso-homem', 'Rend (Bear or Hybrid Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '13', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Slashing damage.', 4),
  ('urso-homem', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The werebear shape-shifts into a Large bear-humanoid hybrid form or a Large bear, or it returns to its true humanoid form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.', 5),
  ('vampiro', 'Multiattack (Vampire Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire makes two Grave Strike attacks and uses Bite.', 1),
  ('vampiro', 'Grave Strike (Vampire Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 9, '8', 'Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 7 (2d6) Necrotic damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of two hands.', 2),
  ('vampiro', 'Bite (Bat or Vampire Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature within 5 feet that is willing or that has the Grappled, Incapacitated, or Restrained condition. Failure: 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage plus 13 (3d8) Necrotic damage. The target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage taken, and the vampire regains Hit Points equal to that amount. A Humanoid reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage and then buried rises the following sunset as a Vampire Spawn under the vampire’s control.', 3),
  ('vampiro', 'Charm (Recharge 5–6)', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire casts Charm Person, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17), and the duration is 24 hours. The Charmed target is a willing recipient of the vampire’s Bite, the damage of which doesn’t end the spell. When the spell ends, the target is unaware it was Charmed by the vampire.', 4),
  ('vampiro', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'If the vampire isn’t in sunlight or running water, it shape-shifts into a Tiny bat (Speed 5 ft., Fly Speed 30 ft.) or a Medium cloud of mist (Speed 5 ft., Fly Speed 20 ft. [hover]), or it returns to its vampire form. Anything it is wearing transforms with it.', 5),
  ('vampiro', 'Legendary Action Uses', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, '3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the vampire can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The vampire regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.', 6),
  ('vampiro', 'Beguile', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire casts Command, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17). The vampire can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.', 7),
  ('vampiro', 'Deathless Strike', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Grave Strike attack.', 8),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire makes two attacks, using Grave Strike or Sickening Ray in any combination.', 1),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Grave Strike', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 10, '9', 'Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (1d8 + 5) Slashing damage plus 13 (3d8) Necrotic damage.', 2),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Sickening Ray', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 10, '16', 'Ranged Attack Roll: +10, range 120 ft. Hit: 16 (2d10 + 5) Necrotic damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the vampire’s next turn.', 3),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Hunger of Hadar (Recharge 5–6)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire casts Hunger of Hadar (level 5 version), requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 18).', 4),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Sanguine Drain', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 18, one creature the vampire can see within 30 feet that isn’t a Construct or an Undead. Failure: 14 (4d6) Necrotic damage. The target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the damage taken, and the vampire regains Hit Points equal to that amount.', 5),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Legendary Action Uses', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, '3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the vampire can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The vampire regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.', 6),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Beguile', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire casts Command, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 18). The vampire can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn.', 7),
  ('vampiro-lorde-umbral', 'Umbral Strike', 'legendary'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Grave Strike or Sickening Ray attack.', 8),
  ('vampiro-traz-noite', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vampire makes one Bite attack and one Shadow Strike attack.', 1),
  ('vampiro-traz-noite', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '7', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Piercing damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage. The target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage taken, and the vampire regains Hit Points equal to that amount.', 2),
  ('vampiro-traz-noite', 'Shadow Strike', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '7', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Slashing damage plus 14 (4d6) Cold damage.', 3),
  ('vampiro-traz-noite', 'Shadow Stealth', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'While in Dim Light or Darkness, the vampire takes the Hide action.', 4),
  ('vrock', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The vrock makes two Shred attacks.', 1),
  ('vrock', 'Shred', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '10', 'Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Piercing damage plus 10 (3d6) Poison damage.', 2),
  ('vrock', 'Spores (Recharge 6)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in a 20-foot Emanation originating from the vrock. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. While Poisoned, the target takes 5 (1d10) Poison damage at the start of each of its turns. Emptying a flask of Holy Water on the target ends the effect early.', 3),
  ('vrock', 'Stunning Screech (1/Day)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in a 20-foot Emanation originating from the vrock (demons succeed automatically). Failure: 10 (3d6) Thunder damage, and the target has the Stunned condition until the end of the vrock’s next turn.', 4),
  ('wight', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The wight makes two attacks, using Necrotic Sword or Necrotic Bow in any combination. It can replace one attack with a use of Life Drain.', 1),
  ('wight', 'Necrotic Sword', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 4, '6', 'Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) Necrotic damage.', 2),
  ('wight', 'Necrotic Bow', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 4, '6', 'Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 150/600 ft. Hit: 6 (1d8 + 2) Piercing damage plus 4 (1d8) Necrotic damage.', 3),
  ('wight', 'Life Drain', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, one creature within 5 feet. Failure: 6 (1d8 + 2) Necrotic damage, and the target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the damage taken.', 4),
  ('worg', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 5, '7', 'Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage, and the next attack roll made against the target before the start of the worg’s next turn has Advantage.', 1),
  ('worg-dire', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The worg makes three Bite attacks.', 1),
  ('worg-dire', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 10, '15', 'Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (2d8 + 6) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Poison damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the worg’s next turn. While Poisoned, the target can’t regain Hit Points.', 2),
  ('worg-dire', 'Dreadful Howl (Recharge 5–6)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 16, each creature within 30 feet that isn’t a worg. Failure: 36 (8d8) Psychic damage, and the target has the Frightened condition until the start of the worg’s next turn. Success: Half damage only.', 3),
  ('worg-dire', 'Warp Step', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The worg teleports, along with a willing creature of its choice within 5 feet of it, up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space it can see.', 4),
  ('wraith', 'Life Drain', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '21', 'Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 21 (4d8 + 3) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, its Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the damage taken.', 1),
  ('wraith', 'Create Specter', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The wraith targets a Humanoid corpse within 10 feet of itself that has been dead for no longer than 1 minute. The target’s spirit rises as a Specter in the space of its corpse or in the nearest unoccupied space. The specter is under the wraith’s control. The wraith can have no more than seven specters under its control at a time.', 2),
  ('wyvern', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The wyvern makes one Bite attack and one Sting attack.', 1),
  ('wyvern', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '13', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Piercing damage.', 2),
  ('wyvern', 'Sting', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '11', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage plus 24 (7d6) Poison damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the wyvern’s next turn.', 3),
  ('xorn', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The xorn makes one Bite attack and three Claw attacks.', 1),
  ('xorn', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '17', 'Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 17 (4d6 + 3) Piercing damage.', 2),
  ('xorn', 'Claw', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '8', 'Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Slashing damage.', 3),
  ('xorn', 'Charge', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The xorn moves up to its Speed or Burrow Speed straight toward an enemy it can sense.', 4),
  ('yeti', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yeti can use its Chilling Gaze and makes two attacks, using Claw or Ice Throw in any combination.', 1),
  ('yeti', 'Claw', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '7', 'Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Slashing damage plus 3 (1d6) Cold damage.', 2),
  ('yeti', 'Ice Throw', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '6', 'Ranged Attack Roll: +6, range 30/120 ft. Hit: 6 (1d4 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 2 (1d4) Cold damage.', 3),
  ('yeti', 'Chilling Gaze', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, one creature the yeti can see within 30 feet. Failure: 5 (2d4) Cold damage, and the target has the Paralyzed condition until the start of the yeti’s next turn unless the target has Immunity to Cold damage. Success: The target is immune to the Chilling Gaze of all yetis (but not abominable yetis) for 1 hour.', 4),
  ('yochlol', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yochlol makes two Caustic Lash attacks, and it can use Spellcasting to cast Web or Dominate Person if available.', 1),
  ('yochlol', 'Caustic Lash', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 8, '25', 'Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +8, reach 10 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 25 (6d6 + 4) Acid damage.', 2),
  ('yochlol', 'Spellcasting', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yochlol casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15):', 3),
  ('yochlol', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yochlol shape-shifts into a Medium Humanoid or a Medium spider or back into its true form. Its game statistics are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.', 4),
  ('yochlol', 'Toxic Escape', 'reaction'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Trigger: The yochlol is hit by an attack roll. Response: The yochlol halves the attack’s damage to itself (round down), and it teleports to an unoccupied space it can see within 30 feet of itself. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature within 5 feet of the yochlol’s destination space. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition until the end of its next turn. While Poisoned, it has the Incapacitated condition.', 5),
  ('yuan-ti-abominacao', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti makes two Bite attacks, and it can use Spellcasting to cast Suggestion if available.', 1),
  ('yuan-ti-abominacao', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 7, '11', 'Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage plus 10 (3d6) Poison damage.', 2),
  ('yuan-ti-abominacao', 'Constrict', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Strength Saving Throw: DC 15, one Large or smaller creature within 5 feet. Failure: 28 (7d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends. Success: Half damage only.', 3),
  ('yuan-ti-abominacao', 'Poison Spray (Recharge 5–6)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. Failure: 21 (6d6) Poison damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the end of the yuan-ti’s next turn. While Poisoned, the target has the Blinded condition. Success: Half damage only.', 4),
  ('yuan-ti-abominacao', 'Spellcasting (Yuan-ti Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15):', 5),
  ('yuan-ti-abominacao', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti shape-shifts into a Large snake or returns to its true form. If it dies, it stays in its current form. The yuan-ti’s game statistics are the same in each form, except where noted. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.', 6),
  ('yuan-ti-infiltrador', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti makes two Scimitar attacks.', 1),
  ('yuan-ti-infiltrador', 'Scimitar', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 3, '4', 'Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d6 + 1) Slashing damage.', 2),
  ('yuan-ti-infiltrador', 'Poison Ray', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 4, '9', 'Ranged Attack Roll: +4, range 120 ft. Hit: 9 (2d6 + 2) Poison damage.', 3),
  ('yuan-ti-infiltrador', 'Spellcasting', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12):', 4),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-1', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti makes two attacks, using Bite or Poison Ray in any combination, and it can use Spellcasting to cast Suggestion if available.', 1),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-1', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 5, '5', 'Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Poison damage.', 2),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-1', 'Poison Ray (Yuan-ti Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 5, '12', 'Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 120 ft. Hit: 12 (2d8 + 3) Poison damage.', 3),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-1', 'Spellcasting (Yuan-ti Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13):', 4),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-1', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti shape-shifts into a Medium snake or returns to its true form. If it dies, it stays in its current form. The yuan-ti’s game statistics are the same in each form, except where noted. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.', 5),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-2', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti makes two Bite attacks, and it can use Spellcasting to cast Suggestion if available.', 1),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-2', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 5, '7', 'Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 10 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage plus 7 (2d6) Poison damage.', 2),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-2', 'Spellcasting (Yuan-ti Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13):', 3),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-2', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti shape-shifts into a Medium snake or returns to its true form. If it dies, it stays in its current form. The yuan-ti’s game statistics are the same in each form, except where noted. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.', 4),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-3', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti makes two Poison Burst attacks, and it can use Spellcasting to cast Suggestion if available.', 1),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-3', 'Poison Burst (Yuan-ti Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 5, '12', 'Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 12 (2d8 + 3) Poison damage.', 2),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-3', 'Constrict', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'Strength Saving Throw: DC 13, one Medium or smaller creature within 5 feet. Failure: 21 (4d8 + 3) Bludgeoning damage. The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends.', 3),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-3', 'Spellcasting (Yuan-ti Form Only)', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 13):', 4),
  ('yuan-ti-malison-tipo-3', 'Shape-Shift', 'bonus'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The yuan-ti shape-shifts into a Medium snake or returns to its true form. If it dies, it stays in its current form. The yuan-ti’s game statistics are the same in each form, except where noted. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed.', 5),
  ('zumbi', 'Slam', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 3, '5', 'Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d8 + 1) Bludgeoning damage.', 1),
  ('zumbi-de-beholder', 'Multiattack', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The zombie uses Eye Rays twice.', 1),
  ('zumbi-de-beholder', 'Bite', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 5, '16', 'Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 16 (4d6 + 2) Piercing damage.', 2),
  ('zumbi-de-beholder', 'Eye Rays', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, NULL, NULL, 'The zombie randomly shoots one of the following magical rays at a target it can see within 120 feet of itself (roll 1d4; reroll if the zombie has already used that ray during this turn):', 3),
  ('zumbi-de-ogro', 'Slam', 'action'::rpg.actor_action_bucket, 6, '13', 'Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage.', 1);

